    "text": "KXII.com\nwebsite\nDenison\nSuspect arrested after standoff at Denison Inn\nBy KXII Staff,\n1 hours agoDENISON, Texas (KXII) - A woman was arrested Wednesday after she allegedly barricaded herself and a child in a Denison motel room. According to the Denison Police Department, officers were trying to serve a warrant at the Denison Inn on Austin Avenue when they learned the suspect had a child inside.",
